        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>腊八粥 课堂笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background: #fdfcf7;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 18px 22px;\n    font-family: \"Kaiti SC\", \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 2.0;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n    max-width: 560px;\n  }\n  .page { position: relative; }\n  .line { position: relative; }\n  .indent2 { text-indent: 2em; }\n  .indent4 { text-indent: 4em; }\n  .indent6 { text-indent: 6em; }\n  .title-row {\n    position: relative;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    margin: 2px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .circled {\n    display: inline-block;\n    width: 22px; height: 22px;\n    border: 2px solid #c62828;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    color: #c62828;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 20px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .big-title {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    color: #1b2a6b;\n  }\n  .red { color: #c62828; }\n  .red-note {\n    color: #c62828;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n  .hl-pink { background: #f6c9dd; }\n  .hl-purple { background: #d8cbe8; }\n  .u-red { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c62828; }\n  .u-blue { border-bottom: 1.5px solid #3355aa; }\n  .strike { text-decoration: line-through; }\n  .side-right {\n    float: right;\n    text-align: left;\n    color: #c62828;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n  }\n  .inline-note {\n    color: #c62828;\n    font-size: 13px;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #999;\n    color: #666;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .footer {\n    margin-top: 10px;\n    border-top: 1px solid #444;\n    padding-top: 4px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n  }\n  .clear { clear: both; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"line\">第二部分:(2~17)写<span class=\"u-blue\">3粥</span>,写八儿等<span class=\"u-blue\">吃3粥</span>的情态。又可分为(2~8)<span class=\"u-blue\">盼粥</span>,</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent4\">(9~11)想粥,(12~13)猜粥,(14~17)看粥。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"title-row\">\n    <span>第三部分:(18~19)喝3粥,写</span>\n    <span class=\"circled\">2</span>\n    <span class=\"big-title\">腊八粥</span>\n    <span style=\"font-size:15px;\">家人八儿吃完饭后满足的情景</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent4\">首句使用了<span class=\"hl-pink\">排比的修辞手法</span>,写出了无论什么年龄段的人在腊八</div>\n  <div class=\"line\">粥面面都变成了嘴馋的孩子,可见腊八粥受欢迎的程度。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">1、初学喊爸爸的小孩子,会出门叫洋车了的大孩子,嘴巴上长了</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">许多白胡子的老孩子,提到<span class=\"hl-pink\">腊八粥</span>,谁不是嘴里就立时生出一种甜</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">甜的腻腻的<span class=\"hl-purple\">感觉</span>呢。把小米、饭豆、枣、栗、白糖、花生仁合拢</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">起来<span class=\"u-red\">糊糊涂涂煮成一锅</span>,让它在锅中<span class=\"u-red\">叹气似的沸腾着</span>,单看它<span class=\"u-red\">那</span></div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\"><span class=\"u-red\">软</span><span class=\"strike\">3粥的时</span>吧塞出的声音,</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">闻闻那种香味,就够咽三口以上的唾沫了。<span class=\"inline-note\">何况</span>是,大碗</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">大碗地装着,大<span class=\"u-red\">匙</span>大匙朝嘴里塞灌呢!</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:9em;\">运用叙比的修辞手法,写出3</div>\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:7em;\">人们对腊八粥的喜爱之情。</div>\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:7em;\">\"疯\"字把八儿的心情表现</div>\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:7em;\">度渲染到3极致。 <span style=\"margin-left:14px;\">↙动作描写</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">2、住方家大院的八儿,今天喜得快要发疯了。他一个人进进出出</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">灶房,看到一大锅粥正在叹气,<span class=\"u-red\">碗盏</span>都已预备整齐,摆到灶边好久</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">了,但妈妈总是说时候还早。<span class=\"red-note\" style=\"margin-left:10px;\">餐具的总称</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:11em;\">心的欢喜和迫不及待的心情</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">3、他妈妈正拿起一把锅铲在粥里<span class=\"u-red\">搅</span>和。锅里的粥也像是益发<span class=\"u-red\">浓</span></div>\n  <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"u-red\">稠</span>了。<span class=\"red-note\">↙两声追叫写出3八儿急切的心情。</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:14em;\">表示八儿的话还没说完就被打断了。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">4、\"妈,妈,要到什么时候才……\"</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">5、\"要到夜里!\"其实他妈妈所说的夜里,并不是上灯以后。但八</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">儿听了这种松劲的话,眼睛可急红了。<span class=\"red-note\">↙神态描写</span></div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">锅中的粥,有声无力的叹气</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">还在继续。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:2em;\">神态描写</div>\n  <div class=\"line\" style=\"font-size:13px; color:#c62828; text-indent:5em;\">可从看出八儿十分急切的想吃到腊八粥。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">6、\"那我饿了!\"八儿要哭的样子。<span class=\"red-note\">与\"太阳落下时\"与\"要到夜里\"相比,时间提前</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent2\" style=\"text-indent:0;\"><span style=\"margin-left:1em;\">7、\"饿了,也不许吃!\"</span><span class=\"u-red\">要到太阳落下时才准吃。</span>\"了应该是<span class=\"red-note\">是八儿最早的时间了。</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"line\">8、饿了,也得到太阳落下时才准吃。你们想,妈妈的命令,看羊</div>\n  <div class=\"line indent2\">还不够<span class=\"u-red\">资格</span>的<span class=\"hl-pink\">八儿</span>,难道还能设什么法来反抗吗?</div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent4\"><span class=\"red\">反问</span>:八儿连看羊都没资格,没办法反抗妈妈的命令。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">本文作者沈从文,选作课文时有改动。<span class=\"hl-pink\" style=\"margin-left:10px;\">沈岳焕</span>,代表作:<span class=\"u-red\">小说《边城》</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"clear\"></div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
